usage: plan.py list [-h] [--plans-root PLANS_ROOT] [--status STATUS]
                    [--phase PHASE] [--applies-to APPLIES_TO]
                    plan kind

list document rows with filters (JSON envelope)

positional arguments:
  plan                  plan id, PLAN<N> or path
  kind                  item, phase, decision, document or unit (plural names
                        also accepted)

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --plans-root PLANS_ROOT
                        plans/ directory (default: nearest up from cwd)
  --status STATUS
  --phase PHASE
  --applies-to APPLIES_TO
